{"id":"3ed0b5289733e3b2","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_IPCSat.md","title":"IPCSat","display":"IPCSat","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"IPCSat","parameters":["w","r","v","b","x","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"IPCSat"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>w</span><span>r</span><span>v</span><span>b</span><span>x</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：直觉主义命题。有序参数：<code>w</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>v</code>、<code>b</code>、<code>x</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ IPCSat w r v b x a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and (@ FmI a) (and (in x w) (exists s (and (@ IPCTable w r v b s) (@ Edge s a x)))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"abaf67a121eca170\" href=\"?note=abaf67a121eca170\" title=\"ZFC_Edge\">Edge</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"315c023b0374de7d\" href=\"?note=315c023b0374de7d\" title=\"ZFC_FmI\">FmI</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"34c30af8e91150ad\" href=\"?note=34c30af8e91150ad\" title=\"ZFC_IPCTable\">IPCTable</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":